I checked, and the dealer had already checked, so the hand goes to showdown. Your 7♠ and Q♦ were face down, so I've turned them up with the rest of your cards. The dealer's 2♦ is also up now.

**Dealer wins.** Your best five cards are Q-10-7-6-4, high card queen. The dealer's are K-J-9-8-5, high card king. The dealer's king beats your queen, and the 60 pot goes to the dealer.

My earlier figures don't add up. Antes and calls as I logged them come to 30, not 60, so I can't confirm the pot or your count from this record. I've left your bankroll at 950 as last shown. If you tell me the correct figures, I'll fix them before the next deal.

